","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:55:07.521Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
{"parentUuid":"ea24eb51-83d4-4279-bf9f-e1af343b83db","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"ac8d66f27603101d9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J23ULbRKEfif6FAjtz9i8h","type":"tool_result","content":"== network-architect\nNetcode model per game type (authoritative server, lockstep, rollback, P2P/relay), network tick and time, authority model, budgets and scale targets, protocol versioning, sharded worlds evaluation.\n  NR ['Transport', 'network-transport']\n  NR ['Replication mechanics', 'replication']\n  NR ['Matchmaking services', 'online-services-liveops']\n== dedicated-server\nHeadless server builds and stripping, host lifecycle (C-SERVER) for rolling deploys, tick cost and multi-instance density, overload degradation, per-connection budgets, the authenticated admin surface, fleet orchestration boundary and server observability.\n  NR ['Fleet operation (outside engine scope)', 'external:backend']\n  NR ['Server logging substrate', 'observability-telemetry']\n  NR ['Sessions & hosting modes', 'net-session']\n  NR ['Zoning, persistence & transactions', 'server-scaleout-persistence']\n== network-transport\nUDP sockets and platform network APIs, reliability and ordering, fragmentation, congestion control, encryption and authentication, NAT traversal and relays, connection lifecycle, link simulation, QUIC/WebTransport evaluation.\n  NR ['What is replicated', 'replication']\n  NR ['Relay service operation', 'external:backend']\n== water-ocean\nOcean spectral simulation, rivers, lakes and shorelines, water surface rendering, water queries for buoyancy.\n  NR ['Buoyancy dynamics', 'rigid-body-dynamics']\n  NR ['Volumetric & particle fluid solvers', 'fluid-simulation']\n== navigation-pathfinding\nNavmesh generation (tiled, runtime rebuild), grid and hierarchical pathfinding, path following, off-mesh links, 3D/volumetric navigation.\n  NR ['Decision making', 'ai-behavior-perception']\n  NR ['Flow-field & mass-agent avoidance', 'crowd-simulation']\n== crowd-simulation\nFlow fields, mass-agent simulation and LOD, traffic; individual-agent local avoidance consumed from C-NAV.\n  NR ['Navmesh', 'navigation-pathfinding']\n  NR ['Individual AI decisions', 'ai-behavior-perception']\n== spatial-audio-acoustics\nHRTF, ambisonics, object-based output, occlusion and obstruction, acoustic propagation, reverb environments.\n  NR ['Collision queries', 'collision-detection']\n  NR ['Mixer', 'audio-dsp-mixing']\n== build-release-architect\nBranching and merge model, engine release trains and versioning, title release-branch/content-lock/hotfix streams, LTS backports, shipped-build archival and rebuildability; pipeline architecture (execution by ci-cd-automation).\n  NR ['Build system implementation', 'build-system-toolchains']\n  NR ['CI pipelines', 'ci-cd-automation']\n  NR ['Packaging', 'packaging-release-patching']\n  NR ['Pipeline orchestration', 'ci-cd-automation']\n[\"PLAT.SVC.matchmaking\", \"Matchmaking / lobby / session integration boundary\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"E\", [\"network-architect\", \"network-transport\", \"net-session\"]]\n[\"WLD.PART.hlod\", \"HLOD strategy & generation orchestration\", \"world-architect\", \"E\", [\"virtualized-geometry-lod\"], [\"lite3d\", \"std3d\"]]\n[\"WLD.ENV.water-render\", \"Water surface rendering\", \"water-ocean\", \"E\", [\"translucency-decals\"]]\n[\"WLD.ENV.buoyancy\", \"Water query service (C-ENV provider: height, velocity, depth, body id)\", \"water-ocean\", \"E\", [\"rigid-body-dynamics\", \"vehicle-physics\"]]\n[\"WLD.ENV.water-interaction\", \"Interactive shallow-water / heightfield water simulation (local surface waves, wakes, flooding)\", \"water-ocean\", \"E\", [\"fluid-simulation\"]]\n[\"WLD.TOOL.water\", \"Water body authoring tools\", \"water-ocean\", \"E\", [\"world-editor-viewport\"]]\n[\"RND.GI.bake-pipeline\", \"Incremental/distributed lighting bake orchestration\", \"global-illumination\", \"E\", [\"content-pipeline-architect\"]]\n[\"PHY.DYN.buoyancy\", \"Buoyancy\", \"rigid-body-dynamics\", \"E\", [\"water-ocean\"]]\n[\"PHY.CTRL.watercraft\", \"Watercraft hydrodynamics beyond buoyancy\", \"vehicle-physics\", \"E\", [\"water-ocean\"]]\n[\"AUD.DSP.panning\", \"Panning & distance models\", \"audio-dsp-mixing\", \"E\"]\n[\"NET.ARCH.model\", \"Netcode model selection (authoritative server, lockstep, rollback, P2P/relay)\", \"network-architect\", \"E\"]\n[\"NET.TRANS.nat\", \"NAT traversal & relays\", \"network-transport\", \"E\", [\"platform-services\"]]\n[\"NET.TRANS.voice\", \"Game-transport voice path (P2P/server-relayed)\", \"network-transport\", \"E\", [\"audio-dsp-mixing\"]]\n[\"NET.TRANS.dos\", \"Anti-amplification handshake, stateless challenges, rate limiting, relay-shielded addressing\", \"network-transport\", \"E\", [\"security-engineering\", \"dedicated-server\"]]\n[\"NET.SRV.orchestration\", \"Fleet orchestration & allocation boundary\", \"dedicated-server\", \"E\", [\"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"NET.SRV.lifecycle\", \"Server lifecycle for rolling deploys: health/readiness, graceful drain, session hand-off, fleet-version coexistence\", \"dedicated-server\", \"E\", [\"network-architect\", \"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"NET.SESS.host-mode\", \"Hosting modes (dedicated, listen, P2P host, relay-hosted) & host migration\", \"net-session\", \"E\", [\"network-architect\", \"dedicated-server\"]]\n[\"GAM.AI.local-avoidance\", \"Local avoidance (ORCA/RVO)\", \"navigation-pathfinding\", \"E\"]\n[\"GAM.AI.validation\", \"Navigation/AI oracles: navmesh connectivity & coverage, path optimality vs exact A*, avoidance without interpenetration\", \"navigation-pathfinding\", \"E\", [\"simulation-validation\"]]\n[\"BLD.CI.devices\", \"Device-farm fleet scheduling & pooling\", \"ci-cd-automation\", \"E\", [\"functional-automation-soak\"], [\"team-large\"]]\n[\"BLD.CI.orchestration\", \"Code \\u2192 content \\u2192 package pipeline orchestration\", \"ci-cd-automation\", \"E\"]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ca8b77c8-5ee5-4e66-be8b-b3279c9a345c","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:55:07.612Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ea24eb51-83d4-4279-bf9f-e1af343b83db","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
