{"parentUuid":"0651f238-ab58-4c31-8cfd-7198ec273b2b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"10d83fbe-32cf-4872-a1ef-e8cfbcf10d96","agentId":"ac8d66f27603101d9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JGFGK4PxBiVnUM99etahfQ","type":"tool_result","content":"plugin-system core-runtime-architect foundation expert runtime ['all']\n   Plugin architecture: manifests, discovery, dependency resolution, load phases, binary vs source plugins, isolation, distribution format.\n  consumes ['C-MOD', 'C-BASE', 'C-API', 'C-SIGN'] tool [] prov ['C-PLUGIN']\n  NR [['Mods & UGC', 'modding-ugc'], ['Module linking internals', 'core-runtime-architect']]\nmodding-ugc gameplay-architect gameplay expert runtime ['ugc']\n   Mod and UGC support: mod SDK, content overrides via VFS layering, sandboxed mod scripting, UGC upload and moderation boundaries, mod compatibility across patches.\n  consumes ['C-VFS', 'C-SCRIPT', 'C-PLUGIN', 'C-SVC', 'C-SIGN'] tool ['C-EDCMD', 'C-EDHOST', 'C-COOK'] prov ['C-EDIT']\n  NR [['Sandbox policy', 'security-engineering'], ['Script VM', 'scripting-runtime']]\nanti-cheat-integrity security-engineering online expert runtime ['all']\n   Cheat resistance for online games: server-authoritative validation patterns (movement, hits, economy), rate limiting, anomaly signals, integration boundary for client anti-cheat middleware.\n  consumes ['C-NET?', 'C-PREDICT?', 'C-PHYS?', 'C-SVC?', 'C-LIVE?', 'C-SRVDATA?', 'C-ML?'] tool [] prov ['C-INTEGRITY']\n  NR [['Replication design', 'replication'], ['Transport encryption', 'network-transport']]\nsecurity-engineering engine-architect quality cross-cutting process ['all']\n   Threat modeling and trust boundaries for every untrusted input, secure-coding and memory-safety policy, supply-chain security, secrets, anti-tamper boundary, privacy engineering, mod/UGC sandbox policy.\n  consumes [] tool [] prov ['C-TRUST']\n  NR [['Cheat detection', 'anti-cheat-integrity'], ['Fuzzing campaigns', 'robustness-fuzzing'], ['Transport encryption implementation', 'network-transport']]\n[\"XC.SEC.server-validation\", \"Server-side cheat validation\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [], [\"online\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.anticheat\", \"Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [], [\"online\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.abuse\", \"Exploit & economy-abuse detection signals\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [\"platform-services\"], [\"online\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.score-integrity\", \"Leaderboard & achievement submission validation\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\"]\n[\"XC.SEC.behavioral-detection\", \"Server-side behavioral / ML cheat detection from telemetry\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"M\", [\"observability-telemetry\", \"ml-inference-runtime\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.attestation\", \"Device/app attestation tokens (Play Integrity, App Attest, platform-signed tokens), server verification, graceful degradation\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [\"platform-mobile\", \"platform-desktop\", \"platform-console\", \"platform-services\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.usermode-anticheat\", \"User-mode & attestation-based anti-cheat posture (kernel-driver deprecation pressure, Proton/ARM)\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"M\"]\n[\"XC.SEC.info-hiding\", \"Information hiding: server-side visibility/fog culling, delayed reveal, per-netcode-model information-leak & host-trust assessment\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [\"replication\", \"prediction-rollback\"]]\n{\n \"id\": \"C-INTEGRITY\",\n \"layer\": 3,\n \"owner\": \"anti-cheat-integrity\",\n \"name\": \"Integrity validation hooks\",\n \"summary\": \"Validator registration per authoritative action (movement deltas, hits, economy), anomaly-signal sink, rate-limit policy, client anti-cheat middleware boundary, attestation results.\",\n \"requires\": [\n  \"C-ID\",\n  \"C-FRAME\"\n ],\n \"conformance\": true,\n \"oracle_author\": \"platform-services\"\n}\nplatform-services consumes ['C-INTEGRITY?']\nprediction-rollback consumes ['C-INTEGRITY?']\ndedicate