ion for console OS (C-PAL backend: OS services, windowing, threads, clocks, IO, display, power, events)\", \"platform-console\", \"E\", [\"platform-architect\"]]\n[\"PLAT.CON.confidential-slots\", \"Confidential implementations of registered slots (IO/decompression units, audio endpoints, save storage, crash upload, system keyboard, entitlement SDK) behind public interfaces owned by domain skills\", \"platform-console\", \"E\", [\"async-io-storage\", \"audio-architect\", \"persistence-save\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"text-fonts\"]]\n[\"PLAT.MOB.links\", \"Deep links & attribution boundary (ATT consent)\", \"platform-mobile\", \"E\"]\n[\"PLAT.SVC.matchmaking\", \"Matchmaking / lobby / session integration boundary\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"E\", [\"network-architect\", \"network-transport\", \"net-session\"]]\n[\"PLAT.SVC.moderation\", \"Moderation boundary (UGC, chat, generated content)\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"E\", [\"modding-ugc\"]]\n[\"PLAT.SVC.privileges\", \"Privileges & parental controls at feature boundaries\", \"platform-services\", \"E\", [\"certification-compliance\"]]\n[\"PLAT.SVC.genai-boundary\", \"Remote generative-AI/inference boundary (auth, quotas, cost, latency, routing)\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"M\"]\n[\"PLAT.SVC.admission\", \"Login queue & capacity admission boundary\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"E\", [\"net-session\"]]\n[\"PLAT.XR.runtime-backends\", \"XR runtime backends: OpenXR, visionOS Compositor Services, console XR SDK (confidential slot)\", \"xr-runtime\", \"E\", [\"platform-mobile\", \"platform-console\", \"rhi-metal\"]]\n[\"PLAT.LIVE.support-tools\", \"Player-support data inspection & restoration boundary over NET.SRV.persistence (audited)\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"E\", [\"persistence-save\", \"security-engineering\"]]\n[\"PLAT.COMM.receipts\", \"Server-side receipt/entitlement verification boundary (client only forwards receipts; grants via NET.SRV.transactions)\", \"platform-services\", \"E\", [\"an