ime tracking decoupled from frame boundaries\", \"gpu-memory-resources\", \"E\"]\n[\"RND.SHADER.neural\", \"In-shader small-network evaluation (matrix-vector/tensor intrinsics tier; API-neutral; standalone-dispatch fallback via C-MLGPU)\", \"shader-system\", \"X\", [\"ml-inference-runtime\"], [\"experimental\"]]\n[\"RND.GPU.recording\", \"Parallel command recording; render work as tasks (no dedicated render thread unless an API mandates affinity, by ADR)\", \"gpu-platform-architect\", \"E\", [\"rhi-core\"]]\n[\"ML.RT.inference\", \"Standalone network inference (GPU, CPU paths)\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"M\"]\n[\"ML.RT.training-boundary\", \"Training & dataset pipeline boundary\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"M\"]\n[\"ML.RT.os-models\", \"OS-provided foundation-model APIs as a backend\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"M\"]\n[\"ML.RT.local-remote\", \"Same model interface served locally or through the C-LIVE generative boundary (routing policy, fallback)\", \"ml-inference-runtime\", \"M\", [\"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"ANM.IK.procedural\", \"Procedural animation (look-at, secondary motion, springs)\", \"ik-procedural-animation\", \"E\"]\n[\"AUD.ARCH.devices\", \"Audio device backends\", \"audio-architect\", \"E\"]\n[\"NET.TRANS.local-network\", \"LAN/local-wireless session discovery & hosting without online services (broadcast/mDNS, console ad-hoc)\", \"network-transport\", \"E\", [\"platform-console\", \"net-session\"]]\n[\"NET.PRED.input-commands\", \"Network delivery of C-INPUT command frames: redundancy, jitter buffering, server-side validation hooks (format owned by input-system)\", \"prediction-rollback\", \"E\", [\"input-system\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\"]]\n[\"NET.SRV.orchestration\", \"Fleet orchestration & allocation boundary\", \"dedicated-server\", \"E\", [\"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"NET.SRV.persistence\", \"Server-authoritative persistent player/world data boundary (write-behind, leases, crash consistency, live schema migration)\", \"server-scaleout-persistence\", \"E\", [\"persistence-save\", \"serialization-schema\", \"dedicated-server\"]]\n[\"NET.SRV.transactions\", \"Idempotent economy/inventory transaction boundary\", \"server-scaleout-persistence\", \"E\", [\"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"dedicated-server\"]]\n[\"GAM.SAVE.platform\", \"Platform save APIs & quotas\", \"persistence-save\", \"E\", [\"platform-console\"]]\n[\"UI.FW.platform-dialogs\", \"Platform-mandated dialogs & system keyboard\", \"ui-architect\", \"E\", [\"certification-compliance\"]]\n[\"UI.TXT.ime\", \"Text input & IME integration\", \"text-fonts\", \"E\", [\"platform-architect\"]]\n[\"UI.A11Y.palettes\", \"Semantic color tokens & redundant shape/icon palettes for UI and gameplay highlights\", \"accessibility\", \"E\", [\"ui-architect\", \"post-color-hdr\"]]\n[\"ED.UI.ux\", \"Editor UX standards & usability testing\", \"editor-ui-framework\", \"E\"]\n[\"ED.DEBUG.console\", \"In-game console & cheat commands\", \"visual-debugging-tools\", \"E\"]\n[\"BLD.SYS.platform-sdks\", \"Platform SDK version management & store/cert-mandated minimums\", \"build-system-toolchains\", \"E\", [\"platform-console\", \"platform-mobile\", \"platform-desktop\", \"certification-compliance\"]]\n[\"BLD.REL.cdn\", \"Content delivery boundary\", \"packaging-release-patching\", \"E\", [\"platform-services\"]]\n[\"QA.STRAT.flaky\", \"Flaky-test management: quarantine counts as a skip under QA.AGENT.test-integrity (governed approval, owner, mandatory expiry)\", \"test-architect\", \"E\", [\"ci-cd-automation\"]]\n[\"QA.CERT.programs\", \"Non-console verification programs (Steam Deck Verified, store review)\", \"certification-compliance\", \"E\", [\"platform-desktop\", \"platform-mobile\"]]\n[\"PRF.GPU.tools\", \"Vendor tool expertise across PC, console & mobile\", \"gpu-performance\", \"E\"]\n[\"OBS.LOG.analytics\", \"Gameplay analytics event schema, taxonomy & privacy classes; analytics-SDK boundary\", \"observability-telemetry\", \"E\", [\"security-engineering\", \"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"OBS.CRASH.feedback\", \"In-game bug/feedback capture boundary for players\", \"crash-diagnostics\", \"E\", [\"functional-automation-soak\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.trust\", \"Trust boundaries for untrusted input\", \"security-engineering\", \"E\"]\n[\"XC.SEC.tamper\", \"Anti-tamper & DRM boundary\", \"security-engineering\", \"E\", [\"anti-cheat-integrity\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.anticheat\", \"Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary\", \"anti-cheat-integrity\", \"E\", [], [\"online\"]]\n[\"XC.SEC.agent-boundary\", \"Development-agent capability scoping, sandboxing, egress & prompt-injection threat model\", \"security-engineering\", \"M\", [\"program-orchestration\", \"ci-cd-automation\"]]\n[\"XC.EXT.ugc-discovery\", \"UGC browse/rate/play boundary with moderation & entitlement hooks\", \"modding-ugc\", \"E\", [\"online-services-liveops\"]]\n[\"XC.EXT.mod-editor\", \"Redistributable modder editor/SDK build (licence/NDA stripping, sandboxed tool plugins)\", \"modding-ugc\", \"E\", [\"packaging-release-patching\", \"platform-architect\", \"security-engineering\"]]\n[\"XC.EXT.ugc-integrity\", \"Mod/UGC distribution integrity: package signing via C-SIGN, author identity & 2FA at the distribution boundary, update pinning/review, remote revocation/kill switch, native-code mod policy (sandboxed by default, native only by explicit player opt-in)\", \"modding-ugc\", \"E\", [\"security-engineering\", \"online-services-liveops\", \"platform-services\"]]\n[\"XC.DX.errors\", \"Error-message & diagnostic quality standards\", \"developer-experience-docs\", \"E\"]\n{\n \"id\": \"C-ORCH\",\n \"layer\": \"P\",\n \"owner\": \"program-orchestration\",\n \"name\": \"Agent coordination protocol\",\n \"summary\": \"Ownership ledger with access classes; write sets by module convention (src/<skill-id>/, tools/<skill-id>/; tests owned by the test-owning skill); shared-file protocol; contributor semantics (review + change request, never direct writes); change requests; integration order and milestones; human-gate tasks; failure triage; per-change provenance; critic gates with calibration and independent adjudication; access classes per skill (public | nda:<holder>); NDA work routed only to cleared agents; test write sets: tests/unit/<skill-id>/ implementer-owned; tests/acceptance/<contract-id>/ owned by the contract's oracle_author, read-only (oracle-ro) for implementers.\",\n \"requires\": [],\n \"universal\": \"all\"\n}\n        if not users:\n            W(f\"contract {cid} has no consumers\")\n\n    # -- platform code sits in skills tagged with that platform; console-only skills carry an NDA access class\n    for sid in m.skill_order:\n        s = m.skill(sid)\n        for c in m.owned_caps(sid):\n            area = \".\".join(c[\"id\"].split(\".\")[:2])\n            need = PLATFORM_AREAS.get(area)\n            if need and need not in (s[\"platforms\"] or []):\n                E(f\"skill {sid} owns platform capability {c['id']} but is not tagged platform '{need}'\")\n        if s[\"platforms\"] == [\"console\"] and not str(s.get(\"access\", \"\")).startswith(\"nda\"):\n            E(f\"console-only skill {sid} has no NDA access class\")\n        if str(s.get(\"access\", \"\")).startswith(\"nda\") and s[\"platforms\"] != [\"console\"]:\n            E(f\"NDA skill {sid} is not confined to the console platform\")\n\n    # -- configuration closure (the scale-down proof)\n    for name, cfg in m.configurations.items():\n        profiles, target, platforms = cfg[\"profiles\"], cfg[\"target\"], cfg.get(\"platforms\", [])\n        if not any(p in m.profiles_base for p in profiles):\n            E(f\"configuration '{name}' has no base profile\")","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2793026b-e2b1-4b7c-a5ef-b9e4d5182187","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:57:48.592Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d810c947-52f8-4847-b5ae-e656bd8e7ec1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b8